{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第一次宣材写真",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.second",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天请多指教！她是我们的新人——",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "樋口円香。请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（摄影师说要准备一下布景。那就稍等一会儿。）",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不用紧张。放松肩膀，全力以赴就好！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "真是工作热心的人呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？是、是吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "是的。热心得让人受不了。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……嘛，这算是我的长处吧。不过最近因为加班被骂的时候也很多——",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "是吧。ミスター・オールドタイプ。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "非要点燃热情，就没法好好工作吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "高油耗，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——円香……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "吓我一跳，表情很好。不像是第一次拍摄……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那真是太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "用来做宣材照片有点可惜……不过我会拿这个好好推销的！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "好。适可而止地。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（好冷啊……有没有什么能打动円香的东西……）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，对了！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香，过来一下！有偶像的迷你 live！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "哈……？在这种路边？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "CD 店每周都会办的活动。是学习偶像的机会。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看，正好要开始了！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "………………这样啊。"
      }
    }
  },
